ities out there that are going to  need some help and one very small way  that i like to do so  is a company that i work with called tab  for cause which lets you raise money for  charity just by opening up tabs and  browsing the internet and that includes  reproductive rights charities because  they just launched tab for reproductive  health  well because of all of this and that  lets you raise money for non-profit  organizations protecting and providing  access to reproductive health care like  the center for reproductive rights and  planned parenthood i know this is just a  little thing but it's something that you  can do right now from the comfort of  your own home the way it works is the  tab for cause is a browser extension  that allows you to pick the charity of  your choice and then every time you open  up a new tab instead of displaying a  blank page it displays a customizable  tab with a couple of tiny ads and the  money that you generate is then given to  the charity that you choose you can see  in real time how much money is being  generated and you can even customize  this tab in the way that you would like  it and legal eagle tabbers have raised  over 35 000 alone and i know this  because tab for causes finances are 100  transparent so you can see for yourself  how much they've raised and where it's  gone so if that sounds interesting to  you if you'd like to make a small  difference together all you have to do  is click on the link that's on screen  right now or in the description to  install the browser extension and then  that's it then every page that you open  will create revenue that goes to charity  in this case reproductive health  charities so all you have to do is click  on the link that's on screen or feel  free not to as well and until next time  i will see you in court

